    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/27a-oakwood-apartments-the-glen-bettyglen-raheny-dublin-d05-r573\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 27A Oakwood Apartments, Raheny.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Raheny, this apartment offers a charming blend of comfort and convenience in the desirable Bettyglen neighbourhood. This one-bedroom apartment is part of a modern development, distinguished by its crisp architectural lines and well-maintained communal areas. The exterior features lush landscaping with mature shrubs and neat pathways, creating a welcoming facade.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a bright and airy space. The open-plan living area is generously proportioned, allowing for both lounging and dining. Large windows flood the room with natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The kitchen is modern and efficient, equipped with sleek cabinetry and essential appliances that cater to contemporary needs.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom is spacious, featuring built-in wardrobes that offer ample storage while maintaining the room’s uncluttered feel. The bathroom is well-appointed, boasting high-quality fixtures and a tasteful finish.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan reveals a practical layout, offering an efficient use of space that maximises the living areas. There is a modest balcony accessible from the living room, ideal for enjoying a quiet moment outdoors.\r\n\r\nPositioned near the centre of Raheny, residents benefit from excellent local amenities, including restaurants, shops, and cafes, all within walking distance. The area is well-served by public transport, with nearby bus stops offering regular services, ensuring easy access to Dublin city centre. The neighbourhood is also in close proximity to scenic parks and recreational facilities, appealing to those who appreciate an active lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThis property is ideal for first-time buyers looking to take their first step onto the property ladder or investors seeking a solid rental opportunity in a sought-after location. Its convenient layout and strategic location make it a practical choice for a range of buyers."
      },
